      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Timur brings an acquaintance to inspect Mikhail Jekovich's pony. When Mikhail mentions that the little horse loves carrots, the buyer remarks that they will cook him with carrots for a Tatar restaurant—horrifying Mikhail.",
      "gap": 0.8
